OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FTonight will
OL,6,Fbe murky for many with low cloud,
OL,7,Fpatchy rain and fog. Temperatures will
OL,8,Fbe near average, but a touch chillier
OL,9,Fthan Wednesday night and winds remain
OL,10,Flight throughout.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FMurky and wet conditions clear
OL,13,Fon Friday, with sunny spells
OL,14,Fdeveloping later. Winds will be light
OL,15,Fand daytime temperatures near normal,
OL,16,Fbut dropping overnight with widespread
OL,17,Ffrost and patchy fog.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
